{"1996740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dagger Woods VR", "steam_appid": 1996740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dagger Woods VR is a <strong>psychological thriller escape room </strong>inspired by <strong>true events and legends of Nova Scotia, Canada</strong>. Combining escape-room-style puzzles, atmospheric exploration, and branching narrative, the game invites players to confront supernatural forces, unravel mysteries, and make decisions with lasting consequences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996740/extras/8039e03c1acbd9a6ce23efcb96f3983b.poster.avif?t=1764545513\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996740/extras/8039e03c1acbd9a6ce23efcb96f3983b.webm?t=1764545513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996740/extras/8039e03c1acbd9a6ce23efcb96f3983b.mp4?t=1764545513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the snow-laden<strong> Dagger Woods in 1960s Nova Scotia</strong>, the story follows <strong>Maggie Carmichael</strong>, a single mother whose three children mysteriously vanish. Maggie begins to suspect that her children's disappearance is connected to previous historical events that link her case to the infamous <strong>unsolved case</strong> of <strong>Mary-Ellen MacDonald</strong> and <strong>the fires of Caledonia Mills, NS</strong>, in <strong>1922</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996740/extras/fd1c7dc94bfa2c24ac599f8908989758.poster.avif?t=1764545513\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996740/extras/fd1c7dc94bfa2c24ac599f8908989758.webm?t=1764545513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996740/extras/fd1c7dc94bfa2c24ac599f8908989758.mp4?t=1764545513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determined to find them, Maggie ventures deep into the woods—only to face the <strong>Hidey-Hinder</strong>, the Dagger Woods Howler. There have been many attempts to find the truth;<strong> what you believe is your choice.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996740/extras/e570de8272a0f7bdd498518b09561340.poster.avif?t=1764545513\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996740/extras/e570de8272a0f7bdd498518b09561340.webm?t=1764545513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996740/extras/e570de8272a0f7bdd498518b09561340.mp4?t=1764545513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Narrative</strong>: Relive her trauma through branching choices that impact her descent into the supernatural truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape-Room Challenges</strong>: Solve intricate puzzles and piece together the story through interactive objects, notes, and environmental storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Historical Lore &amp; Mystery</strong>: Uncover documents, artifacts, and newspaper clippings that connect fiction to real-world history. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Thrills</strong>: Face the unknown. Hear whispers. See visions. And decide what is real—before it's too late.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Adventure</strong>: Your choices are the only thing that matters.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dagger Woods VR is a <strong>psychological thriller escape room </strong>inspired by <strong>true events and legends of Nova Scotia, Canada</strong>. Combining escape-room-style puzzles, atmospheric exploration, and branching narrative, the game invites players to confront supernatural forces, unravel mysteries, and make decisions with lasting consequences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996740/extras/8039e03c1acbd9a6ce23efcb96f3983b.poster.avif?t=1764545513\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996740/extras/8039e03c1acbd9a6ce23efcb96f3983b.webm?t=1764545513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996740/extras/8039e03c1acbd9a6ce23efcb96f3983b.mp4?t=1764545513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the snow-laden<strong> Dagger Woods in 1960s Nova Scotia</strong>, the story follows <strong>Maggie Carmichael</strong>, a single mother whose three children mysteriously vanish. Maggie begins to suspect that her children's disappearance is connected to previous historical events that link her case to the infamous <strong>unsolved case</strong> of <strong>Mary-Ellen MacDonald</strong> and <strong>the fires of Caledonia Mills, NS</strong>, in <strong>1922</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996740/extras/fd1c7dc94bfa2c24ac599f8908989758.poster.avif?t=1764545513\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996740/extras/fd1c7dc94bfa2c24ac599f8908989758.webm?t=1764545513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996740/extras/fd1c7dc94bfa2c24ac599f8908989758.mp4?t=1764545513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determined to find them, Maggie ventures deep into the woods—only to face the <strong>Hidey-Hinder</strong>, the Dagger Woods Howler. There have been many attempts to find the truth;<strong> what you believe is your choice.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996740/extras/e570de8272a0f7bdd498518b09561340.poster.avif?t=1764545513\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996740/extras/e570de8272a0f7bdd498518b09561340.webm?t=1764545513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996740/extras/e570de8272a0f7bdd498518b09561340.mp4?t=1764545513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Narrative</strong>: Relive her trauma through branching choices that impact her descent into the supernatural truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape-Room Challenges</strong>: Solve intricate puzzles and piece together the story through interactive objects, notes, and environmental storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Historical Lore &amp; Mystery</strong>: Uncover documents, artifacts, and newspaper clippings that connect fiction to real-world history. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Thrills</strong>: Face the unknown. Hear whispers. See visions. And decide what is real—before it's too late.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Adventure</strong>: Your choices are the only thing that matters.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Relive a traumatizing true story in a psychological thriller escape room. As a mother looking for her missing children, you must escape her endless misery in the snow-covered Dagger Woods. Explore the unsolved case of Mary-Ellen MacDonald and the fires of Nova Scotia in 1922. Who is truly to blame?!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, Persian<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil, Turkish, Polish, Italian, German, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996740/header.jpg?t=1764545513", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996740/1f2deee182ae952030304b32c5bc7d17a9a56e63/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764545513", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996740/1f2deee182ae952030304b32c5bc7d17a9a56e63/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764545513", "website": "https://www.paracosmstudio.ca/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 3 3100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 / AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> OpenXR, SteamVR, Oculus</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel 6-Core i5-9600K / AMD Ryzen 5 3600 6-Core equivalent or greater<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce RTX™ 3060 / Radeon RX 6600 XT equivalent or greater<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> OpenXR, SteamVR, Oculus</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "Paracosm Studio is owned and operated by ​Maritime Digital Art and Design LTD. All rights reserved.", "developers": ["Paracosm Studio"], "publishers": ["Paracosm Studio"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 52, "description": "Tracked Controller Support"}, {"id": 54, "description": "VR Only"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "70", "description": "Early Access"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996740/0f512537aa77e95f88178cdbc4812a9f7b60cb35/ss_0f512537aa77e95f88178cdbc4812a9f7b60cb35.600x338.jpg?t=1764545513", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996740/0f512537aa77e95f88178c